 worker with a lot of stamina, but she lacks her famous sister's magical abilities. When she gets the chance to go to Europe and fight alongside her sister, she gladly volunteers, but first, she'll have to prove herself by competing with another student at her school.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/P4xtO5sZDB8SKT5XK8wZrcTXtW.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 2","episodeNumber":2,"sourceEpisodeNumber":2,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11964","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20454","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"mal","id":"32866","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"68102","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"314267","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]}],"link":"48505","synopsis":"Hikari and her sister are off for Europe. But their plans are interrupted when the Fusou naval fleet is struck by a newly emerged Neuroi nest. It's up to Takami to defend the fleet against this unexpected threat, but she's overwhelmed by the sheer number of enemies. When she uses a dangerous technique to stave off the foes, it's up to the inexperienced and underpowered Hikari to protect the fleet...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/n4GOIY1AzWQP0CDAtpV6yFRbvs3.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 2","synopsis":"Hikari and her sister are off for Europe. But their plans are interrupted when the Fusou naval fleet is struck by a newly emerged Neuroi nest. It's up to Takami to defend the fleet against this unexpected threat, but she's overwhelmed by the sheer number of enemies. When she uses a dangerous technique to stave off the foes, it's up to the inexperienced and underpowered Hikari to protect the fleet...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/n4GOIY1AzWQP0CDAtpV6yFRbvs3.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 3","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11964","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20454","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"32866","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"68102","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"314267","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"48506","synopsis":"Hikari is now a full member of the 502nd, but she's not exactly welcome yet. Compared to the rest of the members, she's woefully underpowered, and the trainer isn't sure she should be allowed to fight with them at all. When one of the girls go missing after returning from a flight, though, she has to go out and find them, and help defend against a Neuroi when it attacks.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gB7KnOyAGjPJgMmUagefDjpEdtz.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 3","synopsis":"Hikari is now a full member of the 502nd, but she's not exactly welcome yet. Compared to the rest of the members, she's woefully underpowered, and the trainer isn't sure she should be allowed to fight with them at all. When one of the girls go missing after returning from a flight, though, she has to go out and find them, and help defend against a Neuroi when it attacks.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gB7KnOyAGjPJgMmUagefDjpEdtz.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 4","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11964","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20454","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"32866","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"68102","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"314267","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"48507","synopsis":"The battle against the Neuroi is a difficult one, and the 502nd is worried that Hikaru doesn't have what it takes. She's issued a challenge: if she wants to remain in the unit, she must use her magic to climb up a tall tower and grab a hat off the top. She's not allowed to fly, and worse, she's only given seven days to do it. As the day of the deadline draws near, she still isn't making progress, but she refuses to give up.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hM6AlYxgtYpsAYrlfhlGGNWzceC.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 4","synopsis":"The battle against the Neuroi is a difficult one, and the 502nd is worried that Hikaru doesn't have what it takes. She's issued a challenge: if she wants to remain in the unit, she must use her magic to climb up a tall tower and grab a hat off the top. She's not allowed to fly, and worse, she's only given seven days to do it. As the day of the deadline draws near, she still isn't making progress, but she refuses to give up.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hM6AlYxgtYpsAYrlfhlGGNWzceC.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 5","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11964","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20454","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"32866","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"68102","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"314267","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"48508","synopsis":"Shimohara, Georgette and Hikari are out on patrol when they find the whole lake near the base has frozen over! It's an ice Neuroi! They engage the enemy, but it's too cold, and freezes their units solid. The Neuroi then proceeds to freeze the entire base! With no one else able to launch, it's up to the three of them to take out this frozen foe.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/n2PP79CyPh8q1aS7lkXC3wePMSV.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 5","synopsis":"Shimohara, Georgette and Hikari are out on patrol when they find the whole lake near the base has frozen over! It's an ice Neuroi! They engage the enemy, but it's too cold, and freezes their units solid. The Neuroi then proceeds to freeze the entire base! With no one else able to launch, it's up to the three of them to take out this frozen foe.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/n2PP79CyPh8q1aS7lkXC3wePMSV.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11964","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20454","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"32866","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"68102","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"314267","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"48509","synopsis":"The base is under attack by an artillery Neuroi! It's striking from a long distance away, and it's being guided by a marker Neuroi inside the town. Sasha leads the team to take out the marker Neuroi inside Petersburg. She's convinced she's never been here before, but she still remembers this place. Since her magical power gives her a perfect memory, how could she have forgotten?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rmFVStpaNfK2RMrkKPQKGh0GQFt.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 6","synopsis":"The base is under attack by an artillery Neuroi! It's striking from a long distance away, and it's being guided by a marker Neuroi inside the town. Sasha leads the team to take out the marker Neuroi inside Petersburg. She's convinced she's never been here before, but she still remembers this place. Since her magical power gives her a perfect memory, how could she have forgotten?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rmFVStpaNfK2RMrkKPQKGh0GQFt.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11964","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20454","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"32866","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"68102","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"314267","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"48510","synopsis":"It's time for the Saturnus festival, and there's no food to celebrate with! What's worse, Hikari has come down with a cold from all the stress she's under. Nipa and Kanno decide to put on a Christmas celebration anyway, using local mushrooms and hand-carved presents, but their plans are interrupted by a surprise Neuroi attack. Can a surprise visit from Grandpa Winter save the day?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hXaQFmojyINlVByDUiU3BR8XT2c.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 7","synopsis":"It's time for the Saturnus festival, and there's no food to celebrate with! What's worse, Hikari has come down with a cold from all the stress she's under. Nipa and Kanno decide to put on a Christmas celebration anyway, using local mushrooms and hand-carved presents, but their plans are interrupted by a surprise Neuroi attack. Can a surprise visit from Grandpa Winter save the day?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hXaQFmojyINlVByDUiU3BR8XT2c.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11964","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20454","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"32866","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"68102","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"314267","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"48511","synopsis":"The Witches are preparing for a large-scale attack on the Neuroi nest, and to do that they'll need a new weapon. This new weapon is being transported via a supposedly safe route. Krupinski is given the task of defending the convoy. Some of the younger members are a little worried about the always-joking Krupinski, but when a powerful Neuroi attacks, she gets the opportunity to show them what she can do!","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/p1B5KkZg89IyMR6YGvKasHmSnA0.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 8","synopsis":"The Witches are preparing for a large-scale attack on the Neuroi nest, and to do that they'll need a new weapon. This new weapon is being transported via a supposedly safe route. Krupinski is given the task of defending the convoy. Some of the younger members are a little worried about the always-joking Krupinski, but when a powerful Neuroi attacks, she gets the opportunity to show them what she can do!","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/p1B5KkZg89IyMR6YGvKasHmSnA0.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 9","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11964","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20454","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"32866","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"68102","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"314267","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"48512","synopsis":"A new Neuroi has appeared and is threatening the supply lines that the 502nd worked so hard to establish. With the upcoming strike on the Neuroi nest, this threat cannot be allowed to stand. But Krupinski injured after the last battle, and the other senior Witches disabled, it falls to Kanno to lead the charge in her first real command experience.","thumbnail":"h